      assign vpd_why = 'All-Wheel Beast Drive tackles 50° (119% Grade) slopes — where other mowers stall, the S1 4WD keeps climbing|10 cm obstacle clearance plus aggressive grip tread tires crush tree roots, exposed rocks, and uneven ground without losing momentum|1985W peak cutting power with 8.13 N·m torque chews through 1.3 m tall, matted, wet grass without bogging down|Multi-season yard care: discharge, mulch, bag, and a 931 CFM leaf-shredding vacuum — replaces mower, rake, and blower in one machine|No RTK setup, no app pairing, no fuel — pick up the remote and mow in seconds, from up to 400 m away|Engineered by former DJI experts, built with aircraft-grade aluminum body and DC06 deep-draw steel deck for years of heavy use'
      assign vpd_features = '50° (119%) slope, 10 cm obstacle clearance|53 cm deck, 1985W peak cutting power|2000 ㎡/h coverage (3× faster)|Runtime up to 2.25h (18Ah) / 1.5h (12Ah)|Discharge, Mulch, Bag + Leaf-Shredding Vacuum|4-Motor AWD, FOC torque control, 5ms response'
      assign vpd_image = 'products-vesper-s1-4wd-50.webp'
      assign vpd_price_text = '$2,499.00'
      assign vpd_best = 'true'
      assign vpd_new = 'true'
    when 'vesper-s1-4wd-40'
      assign vpd_code = 'Mowrator S1 4WD'
      assign vpd_name = '85% SLOPE(40°)'
      assign vpd_category_name = 'Lawn Mower'
      assign vpd_category_id = 'lawn-mower'
      assign vpd_tagline = 'Remember the joy of RC cars as a kid? We brought that feeling back to your lawn.'
